=========================================================
 DIAGRAM KABEL (WIRING) 
=========================================================

[1. SUMBER DAYA & PENURUN TEGANGAN]
Panel Surya (+)    ======> SCC (Baut Logo Panel +)
Panel Surya (-)    ======> SCC (Baut Logo Panel -)

SCC (Baut Aki +)   ======> Aki 12V (Kutub Positif +)
SCC (Baut Aki -)   ======> Aki 12V (Kutub Negatif -)

Aki 12V (+)        ======> Step-Down (Baut IN+)
Aki 12V (-)        ======> Step-Down (Baut IN-)
  *(Catatan: Putar sekrup Step-Down sampai output 5.0V)*

Step-Down (OUT+)   ======> [ TERMINAL BLOCK POSITIF (+) ]
Step-Down (OUT-)   ======> [ TERMINAL BLOCK NEGATIF (-) ]


---------------------------------------------------------
[2. SENSOR ULTRASONIK (JSN-SR04T)] -> Cek Volume Kohe
Pin VCC (Daya)     ======> Terminal Block Positif (+)
Pin GND (Ground)   ======> Terminal Block Negatif (-)
Pin TRIG (Kirim)   ======> Arduino Mega (Pin Digital 9)
Pin ECHO (Terima)  ======> Arduino Mega (Pin Digital 8)
---------------------------------------------------------

---------------------------------------------------------
[3. SENSOR AMONIA (MQ-137 / MQ Series)] -> Cek Bau Gas
Pin VCC (Daya)     ======> Terminal Block Positif (+)
Pin GND (Ground)   ======> Terminal Block Negatif (-)
Pin A0 / AOUT      ======> Arduino Mega (Pin Analog A0)
Pin D0 / DOUT      ======> (BIARKAN KOSONG/TIDAK DIPAKAI)
---------------------------------------------------------

---------------------------------------------------------
[4. ARDUINO MEGA] -> Otak Sistem
Pin 5V (Daya)      ======> Terminal Block Positif (+)
Pin GND (Ground)   ======> Terminal Block Negatif (-)
  *(Catatan: Arduino nyala dari Terminal, bukan dari USB)*
---------------------------------------------------------

---------------------------------------------------------
[5. MODUL RELAY 4-CHANNEL] -> Saklar Pemutus
-> Bagian Pin Jarum (Sisi Bawah):
Pin VCC (Daya)     ======> Terminal Block Positif (+)
Pin GND (Ground)   ======> Terminal Block Negatif (-)
Pin IN1 (Sinyal)   ======> Arduino Mega (Pin Digital 7)

-> Bagian Blok Baut Biru (K1 / Relay Pertama):
Baut COM           ======> Aki 12V (Kutub Positif +)
Baut NO            ======> Kaki Pertama Solenoid Valve
---------------------------------------------------------

---------------------------------------------------------
[6. SOLENOID VALVE 12V] -> Kran Pembuang Kohe Cair
Kaki Pertama       ======> Modul Relay (Baut NO pada K1)
Kaki Kedua         ======> Aki 12V (Kutub Negatif -)
---------------------------------------------------------